stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Reading references
  s1: Read failed: Retry
  s2: References listed
  s3: No references
  s4: References listed, more exist
  s5: No references, more exist
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: read fails
  s0 --> s2: first page arrives
  s0 --> s3: first page arrives
  s0 --> s4: first page arrives
  s0 --> s5: first page arrives
  s1 --> s0: reader presses Retry
  s3 --> s2: a reference commits
  s4 --> s2: reader shows more
  s5 --> s2: reader shows more
  s5 --> s4: a reference commits or reader shows more
